361	     * runs collapsed to a single space, and case-insensitive — so differing spacing or casing
362	     * still counts as the same household. The check is skipped when the request opts in via
363	     * {@code sharesHousehold == true}, acknowledging that the new owner shares a household with
364	     * the existing one.
